# ] moves a Today entry's start date a day later; once it is in the future the entry leaves Today.
file <<END
- Read book @start({today-1})
- Walk @due({today})
END
keys gt
see Read book
keys ]
see Read book
keys ]
hide Read book
see ▌ - Walk
quit
saved <<END
- Read book @start({today+1})
- Walk @due({today})
END
